{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Meet bizarre medieval characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A medieval gyaru..? A medieval tanned blond punk...? A statue-worshipping otaku...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though each has lived a different life, they all share one goal: to find the \u201ctreasure chest containing whatever they desire\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a variety of characters and build a powerful party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/be1199b233a678286142de3c6e641341.poster.avif?t=1762756517\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/be1199b233a678286142de3c6e641341.webm?t=1762756517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/be1199b233a678286142de3c6e641341.mp4?t=1762756517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Position yourself and use your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic choices will decide your fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right judgment, defeat the rampaging medieval monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/08245d4e21b413aa1a77fb13f6c9ca13.poster.avif?t=1762756517\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/08245d4e21b413aa1a77fb13f6c9ca13.webm?t=1762756517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041690/extras/08245d4e21b413aa1a77fb1